WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,360
I'm here where are you

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,200
I arrived early at my old location

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,760
How did you get in? Are you dressed like this?

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,920
How could he let you in?

5
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,640
walked in

6
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,970
Chen Yundong, no matter how powerful you are, I can’t get rid of you.

7
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:19,450
But I also warn you

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,900
I'm here to have dinner and chat with my bestie

9
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,500
If you want to follow me, I can't help it

10
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,340
But please stay away from me

11
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:29,630
Don't disturb my normal life, okay?

12
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,940
That's agreed

13
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,000
Yuhan, here it is

14
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:38,970
Stop wearing a mask

15
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,290
There are only two of us in this corner

16
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:42,130
No dog to follow

17
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,570
Moreover, ordinary people cannot enter this place.

18
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:46,250
I'm doing it for your own good

19
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:47,890
This is what I do

20
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:49,210
Am I still afraid of being photographed secretly?

21
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,020
I'm afraid they'll take a picture of you

22
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,900
It will cause trouble in your life by then

23
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:57,600
You celebrities are trouble

24
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,360
Go out to have a meal with your bestie

25
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:00,480
They all act like thieves

26
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:03,790
I feel tired just looking at it and I can’t help it

27
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:04,990
the path you choose

28
00:01:05,110 --> 00:01:08,260
You have to walk even if you're kneeling, okay?

29
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:12,300
Don't deliberately sneer in front of me. Just say it like a star.

30
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:13,580
Miss Zhang

31
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:15,260
Why did you summon me today?

32
00:01:16,050 --> 00:01:17,370
Have you been in love lately?

33
00:01:17,370 --> 00:01:18,370
Which man do you like?

34
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:19,690
Call me out to give you some advice
